        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-20030-20048">Ａ　イヤ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20048-20063"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20063-20066">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20066-20090"><rb>不思議</rb><rt>ふしぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20090-20096">とは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20096-20108"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20108-20134">はない。それで？</seg></p>
