><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20497-20512"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20512-20518">とか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20518-20530"><rb>書</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20530-20550">いたものだ。</seg></p>
