        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-41520-41529">Ｂ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41529-41541"><rb>何</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41541-41562">アに、あれらは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41562-41592"><rb>無神經</rb><rt>むしんけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41592-41601">だから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41601-41613"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41613-41619">らん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41619-41634"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41634-41654">をしてるよ。</seg></p>
